# Example 5: Variable translation table - TGA is Stop in the standard table, Trp(pigment) in the mito table
# The same DNA expresses differently under different tables
#
# Standard table:  ATG START, TGA HALT -> ORF terminates immediately
# Mito table:      ATG START, TGA BUILD_PIGMENT -> continues until TAA, producing pigment

#gene name=morpheus
ATG TGA GCT TAA
#end

#config ticks=1 output=stdout
